{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43727","headline":"句 · 卢休","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春寒酒力迟，冉冉生微红。\n自然草木姓，谁祝元化功。\n湓浦风生破胆愁，血染剑花明帐幕。\n三千车马出渔阳，入门堪笑复堪怜。\n三迳苔荒一钓船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}